{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "ag9ulsic7lt55tim", "title": "17.多轮对话的连贯性保持方法", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h3 data-lake-id=\"83d4d33c\" id=\"83d4d33c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u84ab1dab\" id=\"u84ab1dab\">一、答题思路</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uddd3bd4e\" id=\"uddd3bd4e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7f6c80f1\" id=\"u7f6c80f1\">多轮对话的连贯性保持是对话系统的核心挑战之一，涉及上下文管理、状态跟踪、信息持久化等技术。以下是结构化解答思路：</span></p><ol list=\"u9ae4a567\"><li fid=\"ub0332d94\" data-lake-id=\"ufcb524ec\" id=\"ufcb524ec\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9f213fc7\" id=\"u9f213fc7\">问题定义</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uef589aaf\" id=\"uef589aaf\">：明确多轮对话连贯性的核心挑战（如上下文丢失、信息断层、意图漂移）。</span></li><li fid=\"ub0332d94\" data-lake-id=\"ucc26173e\" id=\"ucc26173e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u54436d5c\" id=\"u54436d5c\">技术方法</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u10bc6335\" id=\"u10bc6335\">：分述关键技术（如上下文窗口管理、状态机、记忆增强、Prompt工程）。</span></li><li fid=\"ub0332d94\" data-lake-id=\"u28f1e0c5\" id=\"u28f1e0c5\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ude3374b8\" id=\"ude3374b8\">项目案例</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8e2d9dad\" id=\"u8e2d9dad\">：结合真实项目（如电商客服系统），说明场景痛点、解决方案及效果。</span></li><li fid=\"ub0332d94\" data-lake-id=\"u1b19c5e1\" id=\"u1b19c5e1\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6d4a804f\" id=\"u6d4a804f\">总结归纳</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9fe179c8\" id=\"u9fe179c8\">：提炼方法论与行业通用实践。</span></li></ol><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22FQFYo%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"6c12541a\" id=\"6c12541a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9996b006\" id=\"u9996b006\">二、项目案例</span></h3><h4 data-lake-id=\"2bcd3672\" id=\"2bcd3672\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue3890d10\" id=\"ue3890d10\">场景：电商智能客服系统</span></strong></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u9ee4756f\" id=\"u9ee4756f\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1753019154059-0ea2f4c2-bb01-4439-9059-0c084bc890fc.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u9c8a7283-4431-4bb4-aac3-3d644ac3f74%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u61d8d512-3df1-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A243.2%2C%22height%22%3A133%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A29860%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A456%2C%22originHeight%22%3A250%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%22%2C%22x%22%3A289%2C%22y%22%3A82%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%E7%97%9B%E7%82%B9%22%2C%22x%22%3A289%2C%22y%22%3A12%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E8%90%BD%E5%9C%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A288%2C%22y%22%3A149%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%22%2C%22x%22%3A288%2C%22y%22%3A217%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%94%B5%E5%95%86%E5%AE%A2%E6%9C%8D%22%2C%22x%22%3A17%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f6f6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u9421b28f%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6fd0b492\" id=\"u6fd0b492\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uef52336d\" id=\"uef52336d\">痛点</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4cdcc013\" id=\"u4cdcc013\">：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9475e59c\" id=\"u9475e59c\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1753019161434-00138716-1026-4423-bf0a-4c49c535a1d6.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u576799ae-d8dc-4560-a106-d3549ed649b%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u61d8d512-3df1-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A275.2%2C%22height%22%3A111%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A22614%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A516%2C%22originHeight%22%3A208%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%87%E4%B8%A2%E5%A4%B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A320%2C%22y%22%3A27%2C%22width%22%3A125%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%95%BF%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%9D%E6%96%AD%E5%B1%82%22%2C%22x%22%3A318%2C%22y%22%3A163%2C%22width%22%3A125%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%8C%91%E6%88%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A44%2C%22y%22%3A95%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%84%8F%E5%9B%BE%E6%BC%82%E7%A7%BB%22%2C%22x%22%3A319%2C%22y%22%3A95%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u6363ba15%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><ol list=\"u16072636\"><li fid=\"ufd3845bd\" data-lake-id=\"ud5971311\" id=\"ud5971311\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u404352e9\" id=\"u404352e9\">上下文丢失</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4c212f61\" id=\"u4c212f61\">：用户咨询订单状态后追问退货政策，模型遗忘订单号。</span></li><li fid=\"ufd3845bd\" data-lake-id=\"u2d758fdd\" id=\"u2d758fdd\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1c91917f\" id=\"u1c91917f\">意图漂移</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u53772a08\" id=\"u53772a08\">：用户从“物流查询”跳转到“优惠券使用”，模型无法关联需求。</span></li><li fid=\"ufd3845bd\" data-lake-id=\"uc8e3cce2\" id=\"uc8e3cce2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u77563c14\" id=\"u77563c14\">长对话断层</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2b5596ff\" id=\"u2b5596ff\">：10轮以上对话后，模型回复偏离核心问题（如重复询问订单号）。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"udf954807\" id=\"udf954807\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua520c8d1\" id=\"ua520c8d1\">解决方案</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u83fcaaac\" id=\"u83fcaaac\">：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E4%BC%AA%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%EF%BC%9A%E5%A4%9A%E8%BD%AE%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%9D%E8%BF%9E%E8%B4%AF%E6%80%A7%E4%BF%9D%E6%8C%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6%20%20%5Cnclass%20DialogueSystem%3A%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20__init__(self)%3A%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.context_window%20%3D%20%5B%5D%20%20%23%20%E6%BB%91%E5%8A%A8%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%E6%9C%80%E8%BF%91%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%9D%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.state_machine%20%3D%20%7B%5C%22intent%5C%22%3A%20None%2C%20%5C%22slots%5C%22%3A%20%7B%7D%7D%20%20%23%20%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%9D%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E8%B7%9F%E8%B8%AA%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.external_memory%20%3D%20VectorDB()%20%20%23%20%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E5%BA%93%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%20%20%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20respond(self%2C%20user_input)%3A%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%201.%20%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%87%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%EF%BC%88%E4%BF%9D%E7%95%99%E6%9C%80%E8%BF%913%E8%BD%AE%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%9D%EF%BC%89%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.context_window.append(user_input)%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20len(self.context_window)%20%3E%206%3A%20%20%23%20%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%AE%B9%E9%87%8F%3D3%E8%BD%AE%EF%BC%88%E6%AF%8F%E8%BD%AE2%E6%9D%A1%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%2BAI%EF%BC%89%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.context_window.pop(0)%20%20%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%202.%20%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%86%E5%88%AB%E6%84%8F%E5%9B%BE%E5%92%8C%E6%A7%BD%E4%BD%8D%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20current_intent%20%3D%20self._detect_intent(user_input)%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20current_intent%20%3D%3D%20%5C%22query_order%5C%22%3A%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.state_machine