2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%22%2C%22x%22%3A31%2C%22y%22%3A258%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E5%A2%9E%E5%BC%BA%22%2C%22x%22%3A305%2C%22y%22%3A327%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%22%2C%22x%22%3A304%2C%22y%22%3A464%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E8%B7%9F%E8%B8%AA%22%2C%22x%22%3A306%2C%22y%22%3A190%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ufc81ce55%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><ol list=\"ufe3b86f0\"><li fid=\"u0089f95f\" data-lake-id=\"uc500813f\" id=\"uc500813f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u263ed681\" id=\"u263ed681\">上下文管理技术</span></strong></li></ol><ul list=\"uedd68af3\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ufe5e7a86\" data-lake-id=\"u18c1ebe7\" id=\"u18c1ebe7\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9580348c\" id=\"u9580348c\">动态窗口截断</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u79d33423\" id=\"u79d33423\">：保留最近N轮对话（如ChatGPT的</span><code data-lake-id=\"uabc5ce41\" id=\"uabc5ce41\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue27cf41e\" id=\"ue27cf41e\">max_tokens</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u81742d36\" id=\"u81742d36\">参数），对历史对话生成摘要（如LangChain的</span><code data-lake-id=\"ubae71ea8\" id=\"ubae71ea8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4ac3a412\" id=\"u4ac3a412\">ConversationSummaryBufferMemory</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubf9041c7\" id=\"ubf9041c7\">）。 </span></li><li fid=\"ufe5e7a86\" data-lake-id=\"u9b7e5cbf\" id=\"u9b7e5cbf\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u19784e52\" id=\"u19784e52\">案例应用</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3c3db65e\" id=\"u3c3db65e\">：在医疗问诊系统中，患者连续询问“药剂量”→“副作用”→“替代药”，模型通过摘要压缩前5轮对话为：“患者咨询XX药物，剂量10mg，出现头痛”。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"ufe3b86f0\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u0089f95f\" data-lake-id=\"u9b588b74\" id=\"u9b588b74\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u68532c30\" id=\"u68532c30\">状态显式跟踪</span></strong></li></ol><ul list=\"uf1d2e485\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u0f1a919d\" data-lake-id=\"uf18bff93\" id=\"uf18bff93\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud3ce52f7\" id=\"ud3ce52f7\">槽位填充（Slot Filling）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2cc4e812\" id=\"u2cc4e812\">：定义关键实体（如订单号、日期），通过NER模型提取并持久化。</span></li><li fid=\"u0f1a919d\" data-lake-id=\"u66c50905\" id=\"u66c50905\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3ef2a0ed\" id=\"u3ef2a0ed\">案例应用</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u29bb0f92\" id=\"u29bb0f92\">：银行客服场景中，用户说“转账给张三”，模型记录</span><code data-lake-id=\"uf1731120\" id=\"uf1731120\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1b2c2073\" id=\"u1b2c2073\">payee=张三</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u325fef9b\" id=\"u325fef9b\">；后续用户问“手续费多少？”时直接关联收款人。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"ufe3b86f0\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u0089f95f\" data-lake-id=\"u256ba4c2\" id=\"u256ba4c2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7e95181f\" id=\"u7e95181f\">外部记忆增强</span></strong></li></ol><ul list=\"ue4342eb0\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u05d90eaf\" data-lake-id=\"u41e85957\" id=\"u41e85957\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u465ee806\" id=\"u465ee806\">向量数据库检索</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf3e3b616\" id=\"uf3e3b616\">：将对话中关键实体（如订单ID）存入FAISS/Qdrant，后续对话通过相似度检索召回。</span></li><li fid=\"u05d90eaf\" data-lake-id=\"uc80e5158\" id=\"uc80e5158\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u66fa70ce\" id=\"u66fa70ce\">案例应用</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u55004070\" id=\"u55004070\">：教育辅导场景中，学生先问“牛顿定律”，再问“它的应用案例”，模型从知识库召回“苹果落地”案例注入上下文。 </span></li></ul><ol list=\"ufe3b86f0\" start=\"4\"><li fid=\"u0089f95f\" data-lake-id=\"u259d55a0\" id=\"u259d55a0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u29c72f5d\" id=\"u29c72f5d\">生成控制策略</span></strong></li></ol><ul list=\"u325b5265\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u4d1da346\" data-lake-id=\"ufea95b28\" id=\"ufea95b28\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc6af741f\" id=\"uc6af741f\">约束解码</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u89d1c1c4\" id=\"u89d1c1c4\">：使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u986c08ee\" id=\"u986c08ee\"><span data-lake-id=\"u02c7f143\" id=\"u02c7f143\">no_repeat_ngram_size</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u90e4d6cb\" id=\"u90e4d6cb\">避免重复短语，或</span><code data-lake-id=\"ub0e404d4\" id=\"ub0e404d4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u38e90bac\" id=\"u38e90bac\">repetition_penalty</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u32378ad6\" id=\"u32378ad6\">惩罚复读（Hugging Face Transformers参数）。</span></li><li fid=\"u4d1da346\" data-lake-id=\"u3f745dc2\" id=\"u3f745dc2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucdd04733\" id=\"ucdd04733\">案例应用</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua908a219\" id=\"ua908a219\">：政务热线中，模型通过</span><code data-lake-id=\"uee432765\" id=\"uee432765\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua7e9fab6\" id=\"ua7e9fab6\">temperature=0.3</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u89736628\" id=\"u89736628\">降低随机性，确保政策解答一致性。</span></li></ul><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22BrimS%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"7b2e44f4\" id=\"7b2e44f4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub0553deb\" id=\"ub0553deb\">四、总结归纳</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ub7769967\" id=\"ub7769967\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1753019201659-21ddf859-bda3-49a6-88eb-085b702adb8e.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u4daaf468-e2a0-4cc6-9c73-e3c970493db%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u61d8d512-3df1-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A423.46666666666664%2C%22height%22%3A293%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A96723%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A794%2C%22originHeight%22%3A550%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E5%AE%B9%E9%87%8F%E7%9F%9B%E7%9B%BE%22%2C%22x%22%3A588%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A152%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%AB%AF%E5%8